# NEXORA OFFICE 3D — server-side configuration
#
# Nothing here is required for the demo experience. Without an execution
# endpoint the "Live bridge" adapter fails honestly with
# 501 INTEGRATION_UNAVAILABLE, and the demo adapter (simulated) remains the
# default.
#
# These variables are read only by the server route /api/executions and are
# never exposed to the browser.

# HTTP endpoint that accepts { taskId, agentId, title } and returns
# { ok, summary, simulated?, metrics?, artifacts?, error? }.
# NEXORA_EXECUTION_ENDPOINT=

# Optional bearer token sent to that endpoint.
# NEXORA_EXECUTION_TOKEN=
